# Secrets / credentials
**/auth.txt
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/*.csr
.env
.env.*

# Real VPN profiles
**/*.ovpn
!**/*.ovpn.example

# Runtime / state
**/*.pid
**/*.state
**/*.lock
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*before-*
**/*.recover
**/latest

# Router dumps / backups
**/*.cfg
**/*.bin
**/*.img
**/*.dump
**/*.tar
**/*.tgz
**/*.gz

# Font binaries - keep licensing separate
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
!ui/assets/fonts/README.md

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
